          "description": "Get ready for a heroic adventure where imagination is the ultimate superpower! This musical card follows Rafi, a spirited 6-year-old boy who uses super powers to navigate sticky situations. \n\nOver 10 exciting songs, Rafi conjures up exciting new powers to help him on his way. He'll soar through the skies with \"If I Could Fly,\" race to school as the \"Fastest Human in the World,\" feel his strength grow \"Strong as a Gladiator,\" and try to \"See Into the Future.\" Join him on his ride through a day in the life of Rafi. Are his powers real? There’s only one way to find out! This is the perfect soundtrack for imaginative play, inspiring every child to discover the hero within.\n\nDiscover: 2 tracks. \nAvailable until 31st December. \nFull Card: 10 tracks. \nFor ages 3-12.",
